Description: daemonless container engine for managing OCI containers
 Podman manages pods, containers, and container images without requiring a
 central daemon. It provides a Docker-compatible command line interface and
 supports rootless operation.
 .
 This package is built from upstream releases by the podman-ubuntu project;
 the packaging is maintained to Debian policy with the intent of proposing
 it to Debian/Ubuntu proper.
